    <string name="titan_level1_title">Titan runs passively (Level 1)</string>
    <string name="titan_level1_body">Without a confirmed root or Shizuku channel Titan only sees what any TV app may see: device state, visible packages and local data. No socket radar, no FIM, no vault, no isolation.</string>
    <string name="titan_level1_unavailable">Unavailable at Level 1: socket provenance, FIM anti-planting, app freeze, network quarantine, ADB lockdown, process kill and quarantine vault.</string>
    <string name="titan_no_channel_body">Neither a su binary nor Shizuku was detected. Titan stays passive; activation would not unlock anything.</string>
    <string name="titan_activation_hint">Activation checks the channel passively and may raise one Superuser prompt. Without consent Titan stays at Level 1.</string>
